   "caption": "So I added economics."
  },
  {
   "start": 22.54,
   "end": 25.39,
   "caption": "Then, five years at HARMAN in Bengaluru,"
  },
  {
   "start": 25.8,
   "end": 27.72,
   "caption": "building navigation for cars and trucks."
  },
  {
   "start": 27.77,
   "end": 29.78,
   "caption": "One thing I'm proud of:"
