  },
  {
   "start": 56.04,
   "end": 59.08,
   "caption": "In 2025, I moved to the US."
  },
  {
   "start": 59.42,
   "end": 63.059999999999995,
   "caption": "It's where AI is being built,|and I wanted to be there."
  },
  {
